{"version":1,"key":"card:34","content":{"id":34,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"3959f8ed-466a-4fc5-a04b-1a9a5beeacf0","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"密钥交换算法："}]},{"type":"numbered-list","tauContract":"3a3b4d6f4d2098952ffe3c6e00baedd170e840beb6fb5fc715467ae5845e0156","collabId":"9a0bc072-31b2-48a6-a3b4-ba28e57c65d3","children":[{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"3b89fcf4-26ba-4dfb-b4a0-6c39eee35d45","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"59c61d20-70ef-47cd-b06b-2f3bf53c57a5","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":" RSA"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"6ab0d877-1dd4-453d-a1d3-90a5427996cf","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"使用证书里面的的公钥对本地生成的 pre-master 进行加密，然后传输给服务端，二者使用之前交换的两个随机数和 pre-master 合成会话密钥进行加密通信。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"b7d550b6-bf18-438f-8672-821288be5321","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"缺点是一旦服务端的私钥泄露，之前发送的所有消息都可以被解密出来，前向不安全"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"03a78e3e-c4d8-495e-9b48-928b0684cc49","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"75dd886c-a5eb-46f5-9af6-ec41238d0385","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"DH 交换算法"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"9e65d66e-ba8a-4384-8d2f-50d5b097b6f6","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"服务器本地临时生成一个公钥和私钥，并把公钥传递给客户端，客户端也会生成一对公私钥，并且把公钥传递给了服务端，二者根据传递的公钥以及本地生成的私钥合成一个 pre-master，然后将之前传递的随机数和 pre-master 合成一个会话密钥。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"68a79351-0bea-475c-9d9f-f3137799b861","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"临时生成的公私钥，即使这次私钥泄露，也不能解密出之前发送的消息。但是私钥泄露后，后面的通信就不是安全的了，无法防止中间人攻击。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"1d95ed1b-d332-4c9e-9df0-44d9f6646b4d","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"这种交换密钥算法证书里面的公钥有什么用，答案是用来验证签名的，在服务端将临时生成的公钥传递给客户端时，为了防止被篡改，使用了私钥进行了签名，客户端使用证书里面的公钥来验证签名是否正确，密钥是否被篡改。"}]}]}]}],"tags":["安全/算法"],"createTime":1688963999072,"updateTime":1745221954546,"linkedCards":[]},"meta":{"type":"card","publishTime":1745221954546}}